    "detailed_description": "<h1>ADD TO WISHLIST</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1101760/extras/32f9bf274be5270cdfbc1ada1faa123d.poster.avif?t=1566751013\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1101760/extras/32f9bf274be5270cdfbc1ada1faa123d.webm?t=1566751013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1101760/extras/32f9bf274be5270cdfbc1ada1faa123d.mp4?t=1566751013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong> CRAZY DRIVER </strong> - is an endless car chasing game where you have to avoid police for as long as possible. The goal is to collect as much cash as you can avoiding your car crashing.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1101760/extras/5838a372b56847ae26a4f3b69e821843.poster.avif?t=1566751013\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1101760/extras/5838a372b56847ae26a4f3b69e821843.webm?t=1566751013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1101760/extras/5838a372b56847ae26a4f3b69e821843.mp4?t=1566751013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Features: </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>  variety of vehicles to chose from<br></li><li>  addicting racing gameplay<br></li><li>  7 types of vehicle<br></li><li>  atmosphere of madness</li></ul>",
